Third-party attributions
------------------------

None. keel vendors no third-party code. Every runtime dependency is the
Python 3.10+ standard library, so there is no bundled or inlined source to
attribute here.

If that ever changes — if any third-party text, prompt or code is adapted
into this repository — the attribution its licence requires is recorded in
this section, in the same change that introduces it. This file is where that
obligation is discharged, and no other repository policy overrides it.


